//! GrpcServer - A Rust library for building gRPC + REST services
//!
//! This library provides a framework for creating services that expose gRPC
//! and REST endpoints with protocol multiplexing, health checks, CORS support,
//! and graceful shutdown.
//!
//! ## Features
//!
//! - TLS gRPC server (tonic) with REST/HTTP endpoints multiplexed through ALPN
//! - Health check endpoint at `/health`
//! - CORS middleware for REST endpoints
//! - Graceful shutdown on SIGINT/SIGTERM
//! - Integrated rule-based authorization via Authorizer
//! - Server lifecycle management
//!
//! ## Architecture
//!
//! The GrpcServer manages a TLS listener for protobuf-based RPC and HTTP
//! endpoints. It refuses to start without certificate material.
//!
//! Both servers are managed by a single shutdown coordinator that ensures
//! graceful termination when a shutdown signal is received.

